Use alloc, core, fs, io, list, map, math, and string.

Let root be square root of 2.0.
Say root.

Let nums be List of whole number.
Push 4 to address of nums.
Let first value be item 0 of nums's data.
Say first value.
Free list address of nums.

Let table be IntMap of whole number.
Let k be 0 as a whole number.
While k is less than 3.
Put k times 2 into int map address of table for key k.
Add 1 to k.
End the loop.
Let found be look up 1 in int map address of table.
Say found.value.
Let map size be count of int map address of table.
Say map size.
Free int map address of table.

Let name be create text from "audit.txt" of length 9.
Save 7 to file address of name.
Display file address of name.
Delete file address of name.
Release text address of name.

Let used be bytes in use.
Say used.
Give back 0.
